  "scope": "The negative-only guard runs only after dispatch to FILE_WRITE and entry into the file-save resolver/file.save.interpret path. It applies to a core-recorded missing-target question bound to one eligible known answer in the same positive project, when the entire newest reply is two distinct relative filename atoms joined by nebo/or. It never chooses a target or promotes clarify/decline to write.",
